	uired)\nLanguage: En Español (Spanish-language performance)\nSeating: Gene
	ral Admission (first-come\, first-served)\nMinimum: 2-item food/drink mini
	mum per person \nAbout Rogelio Ramos\nRogelio Ramos is one of the most pop
	ular Spanish-language stand-up comedians in the United States and Latin Am
	erica. Known for his energetic performances and sharp cultural observation
	s\, Ramos has built a massive following with his relatable humor about fam
	ily\, relationships\, and everyday life. His shows consistently sell out a
	cross the country. \nWhat to Expect\n\nHigh-energy Spanish-language stand-
	up comedy\nHilarious cultural observations and family humor\nIntimate come
	dy club atmosphere at Chicago Improv\nFull food and drink service (2-item 
	minimum)\n21+ event — valid photo ID required\nDoors open at 5:00 PM — arr
	ive early for best seats\n\nVenue Information\nChicago Improv is located i
	nside Woodfield Mall in Schaumburg\, IL\, one of the premier comedy clubs 
