SUMMARY:Zac Townsend LIVE at Punch Line Houston
DTSTAMP:20260806T053906Z
DTSTART:20260806T193000Z
DESCRIPTION:Official TicketsResale Tickets \nAbout Zac Townsend\nZac Townse
	nd is a Nashville-based comedian and writer who accidentally launched his 
	stand-up career after engaging with Michael Blackson in an online roast ba
	ttle so hard that Blackson invited him to his show and handed him a mic. S
	ince then\, Zac has never looked back. He’s now a regular at Zanies Nashvi
	lle and has opened for Shane Gillis\, Andrew Santino\, Joe List\, Doug Sta
	nhope\, Big Jay Oakerson\, Jessica Kirson\, Steve-O\, and Earthquake. \nOf
	f stage\, Zac co-created the viral sketch collective Paid Vacation\, which
	 has amassed over 60 million views across TikTok and Instagram. You’ve als
	o seen him on Barstool Sports\, at the Nashville Comedy Festival\, LMAOF T
	V\, and Bonnaroo. His Houston debut at Punch Line is one of the most excit
	ing new bookings of the summer. \nEvent Details\nDate: Thursday\, August 6
	\, 2026\nShow Time: 7:30 PM\nVenue: Punch Line Houston\nAddress: 1204 Caro
	line Street\, Houston\, TX 77002\nAge Restriction: 18+ / 2 Beverage Minimu
	m\nTicket Price: From $28 \nAbout Punch Line Houston\nPunch Line Houston i
	s downtown Houston’s premier stand-up comedy club\, located at 1204 Caroli
	ne Street. Part of the nationally recognized Punch Line Comedy Club brand\
	, this intimate venue delivers an up-close comedy experience that puts you
	 right in the action. \nThe club features table seating\, a full-service b
	ar\, and a two-drink minimum. The intimate setting is perfect for Zac’s sh
	arp\, crowd-driven style. Parking is available in nearby downtown Houston 
	garages. \nWhat to Expect\nZac Townsend’s live show is a high-energy\, lau
	gh-packed set from one of comedy’s most exciting rising voices. He brings 
	the same fearless energy that made his viral content explode online — raw\
	, unfiltered\, and consistently funny. Expect sharp observations\, crowd i
	nteraction\, and a room that’s fully locked in from start to finish. \nThi
	s is a Thursday night show at Punch Line Houston on August 6 at 7:30 PM. T
	his is an 18+ event with a two-beverage minimum per guest. Tickets are lim
	ited — grab yours early. \nTicket Information\nPrice: From $28\nTickets av
	ailable via Ticketmaster (official) or VividSeats (resale). \nOfficial Tic
	ketsResale Tickets \nThis post contains affiliate links. We may earn a com
	mission at no extra cost to you.\n\nhttps://comedycalendar.com/event/zac-t
	ownsend-live-at-punch-line-houston/\n\nFrom Comedy Calendar
URL:https://comedycalendar.com/event/zac-townsend-live-at-punch-line-housto
	n/
LOCATION:Punch Line Houston\, 1204 Caroline Street\, Houston\, TX\, 77002\,
	 United States
