DESCRIPTION:Official TicketsResale Tickets \nAbout Ron Funches\nRon Funches
	 is the human embodiment of a warm hug that somehow learned to roast you —
	 with love. A master of joyful\, disarming stand-up\, Ron has released mul
	tiple acclaimed comedy specials and is a fan-favorite on TV series includi
	ng Peacock’s The Traitors\, Apple TV’s Loot\, and FOX’s New Girl. His voic
	e acting career is equally impressive — you’ve heard him in Pixar’s Inside
	 Out 2\, the DreamWorks Trolls franchise\, and Harley Quinn. \nWith numero
	us late-night appearances\, writing credits\, and a reputation as one of t
	he warmest performers in comedy\, Ron Funches turns warmth\, weirdness\, a
	nd razor-sharp jokes into pure delight. His live shows are consistently pr
	aised for their positive energy\, genuine connection with the audience\, a
	nd non-stop laughs from start to finish. \nEvent Details\nDate: Friday\, A
	ugust 7\, 2026\nShow Time: 7:00 PM (Late show at 9:15 PM also available)\n
	Venue: Punch Line Houston\nAddress: 1204 Caroline Street\, Houston\, TX 77
	002\nAge Restriction: 18+ / 2 Beverage Minimum\nTicket Price: From $38 \nA
	bout Punch Line Houston\nPunch Line Houston is downtown Houston’s premier 
	stand-up comedy club\, located at 1204 Caroline Street. Part of the nation
	ally recognized Punch Line Comedy Club brand\, this intimate venue deliver
	s an up-close comedy experience that puts you right in the action. \nThe c
	lub features table seating\, a full-service bar\, and a two-drink minimum.
	 The warm\, intimate atmosphere is a perfect match for Ron’s signature sty
	le of joyful\, crowd-connecting comedy. Parking is available in nearby dow
	ntown Houston garages. \nWhat to Expect\nRon Funches’ live show is a maste
	rclass in feel-good comedy. He has a rare ability to make an entire room f
	eel like they’re in on the joke together — his warmth is infectious\, his 
	timing is impeccable\, and his punchlines consistently land harder than yo
	u expect. Fans of his TV work will find his stand-up even more personal an
	d hilarious. \nRon is performing a full weekend run at Punch Line Houston 
	— Friday August 7 at 7:00 PM and 9:15 PM\, and Saturday August 8 at 7:00 P
	M and 9:15 PM. This is an 18+ event with a two-beverage minimum per guest.
	 \nTicket Information\nPrice: From $38\nTickets available via Ticketmaster
	 (official) or VividSeats (resale). \nOfficial TicketsResale Tickets \nThi
	s post contains affiliate links. We may earn a commission at no extra cost
	 to you.\n\nhttps://comedycalendar.com/event/ron-funches-live-at-punch-lin
	e-houston/\n\nFrom Comedy Calendar
