SUMMARY:Tiffany Haddish LIVE at Chicago Improv
DTSTAMP:20260806T053907Z
DTSTART:20260807T190000Z
DESCRIPTION:This post contains affiliate links. We may earn a commission at
	 no extra cost to you. \nOfficial TicketsResale Tickets \nAbout the Perfor
	mer\nTiffany Haddish is one of the most celebrated comedic talents of her 
	generation. An Emmy Award winner\, Grammy Award winner\, and NAACP Image A
	ward recipient\, Haddish has established herself as one of the most sought
	-after performers in Hollywood and on the stand-up stage. \nBest known for
	 her breakout performance in the smash hit Girls Trip\, Haddish has since 
	starred in Bad Boys: Ride or Die\, Apple TV+’s The Afterparty\, and The Un
	bearable Weight of Massive Talent. She won the Emmy Award for hosting Satu
	rday Night Live — becoming the first Black female stand-up comedian to hos
	t the show — and a Grammy for her comedy special Tiffany Haddish: Black Mi
	tzvah. She is also a New York Times bestselling author of The Last Black U
	nicorn. \nCurrently on her Funny and Fearless Tour\, Haddish is bringing a
	 brand-new stand-up set to audiences across the country. Expect raw\, hone
	st\, and deeply funny storytelling from one of comedy’s brightest stars. H
	er comedy draws from her remarkable life story — growing up in foster care
	\, overcoming adversity\, and finding her voice through laughter. \nEvent 
	Details\n\nDate: Friday\, August 7\, 2026\nShow Time: 7:00 PM CDT (Doors o
	pen at 5:00 PM)\nSecond Show: 9:30 PM CDT also available\nAdditional Shows
	: Saturday August 8 (7:00 PM & 9:30 PM) and Sunday August 9 (6:00 PM)\nVen
	ue: Chicago Improv\nAddress: 5 Woodfield Mall K120B\, Schaumburg\, IL 6017
	3\nAge Restriction: 21+ only. Valid ID required at entry.\nTicket Prices: 
	$38 GA / $52 VIP (plus fees)\nNote: Two-item minimum purchase per person i
	n the showroom. No photography or video recording during the show. All sal
	es are final.\n\nAbout the Venue\nChicago Improv is the Chicago area’s pre
	mier comedy club\, located inside the Woodfield Mall in Schaumburg\, Illin
	ois — just 30 miles northwest of downtown Chicago. Part of the nationally 
	recognized Improv comedy club chain\, Chicago Improv has hosted some of th
	e biggest names in stand-up comedy for decades. \nThe showroom features ge
	neral admission seating with host-escorted placement\, ensuring every gues
	t gets a great view of the stage. The intimate club atmosphere puts you ri
	ght in the middle of the action\, with a full bar and a mandatory two-item
	 minimum per guest. VIP and premium booth seating is available for groups\
	, offering a more exclusive experience with premium viewing. \nThe venue i
	s easily accessible from I-90 and Route 53\, with ample parking available 
	throughout the Woodfield Mall complex. The surrounding mall offers plenty 
	of dining and shopping options for a complete night out in the suburbs. Ch
	icago Improv is a 21+ venue for all shows. \nWhat to Expect\nThis is a sol
	o headlining stand-up performance by Tiffany Haddish as part of her Funny 
	and Fearless Tour. Expect a high-energy\, deeply personal\, and laugh-out-
	loud funny show from one of the biggest names in comedy today. Haddish is 
	known for her infectious energy\, crowd interaction\, and willingness to s
	hare the most personal and outrageous stories from her life. \nHer shows f
	eel like a conversation with your funniest\, most real friend — warm\, wil
	d\, and completely unforgettable. This is a rare chance to see an Emmy and
	 Grammy-winning comedian in an intimate club setting. Multiple shows are a
	vailable across the weekend (August 7-9)\, so there are plenty of opportun
	ities to catch this incredible performer. Arrive early to grab a drink and
	 a great seat before the show begins. \nTicket Information\nPrice: $38 GA 
	($50.05 with fees) / $52 VIP ($68.30 with fees) \nTickets are available th
	rough Ticketmaster (official) and VividSeats (resale). This is a 21+ event
	. All sales are final — no refunds or exchanges. Tiffany Haddish shows sel
	l out fast — secure your seats now! \nOfficial TicketsResale Tickets \nThi
	s post contains affiliate links. We may earn a commission at no extra cost
	 to you.\n\nhttps://comedycalendar.com/event/tiffany-haddish-live-at-chica
	go-improv/\n\nFrom Comedy Calendar
URL:https://comedycalendar.com/event/tiffany-haddish-live-at-chicago-improv
	/
LOCATION:Chicago Improv\, 5 Woodfield Mall\, Schaumburg\, IL\, 60173\, USA
