DESCRIPTION:This post contains affiliate links. We earn a commission if you
	 purchase tickets through our links at no extra cost to you. \nOfficial Ti
	ckets \nResale Tickets \nKill Tony LIVE at Madison Square Garden\nOne of t
	he most electrifying live comedy podcast experiences in the world\, Kill T
	ony returns to the iconic Madison Square Garden in New York City for a mas
	sive one-night event on August 7\, 2026. Hosted by Tony Hinchcliffe\, Kill
	 Tony is a weekly live podcast where unknown comedians get exactly 60 seco
	nds to perform stand-up\, followed by feedback from Tony and a rotating pa
	nel of celebrity guests. At MSG\, expect a sold-out crowd\, surprise celeb
	rity appearances\, and the raw\, unfiltered comedy that has made Kill Tony
	 a global phenomenon. \nEvent Details\nDate: Friday\, August 7\, 2026\nTim
	e: 7:00 PM\nVenue: Madison Square Garden\nAddress: 4 Pennsylvania Plaza\, 
	New York\, NY 10001\nCapacity: ~20\,000\nParking: Available at MSG parking
	 facilities and nearby garages\nAge Requirement: All ages (18+ recommended
	 for content) \nAbout Kill Tony\nKill Tony is a weekly live podcast hosted
	 by comedian Tony Hinchcliffe\, produced by Rooster Teeth and recorded liv
	e in Austin\, Texas — and now touring the world’s biggest arenas. The show
	 features unknown comedians performing 60-second sets judged by Tony and c
	elebrity guests\, creating unpredictable\, hilarious\, and often jaw-dropp
	ing moments. Kill Tony previously sold out Madison Square Garden and is ba
	ck for another legendary night at The World’s Most Famous Arena. \nWhat to
	 Expect\n\nTony Hinchcliffe hosting a live taping of the Kill Tony podcast
	\nUnknown comedians competing in 60-second stand-up sets\nSurprise celebri
	ty guest appearances\nUnfiltered\, raw comedy in front of a massive MSG cr
	owd\nAn electric\, one-of-a-kind live event experience\nTwo-night run at M
	SG (Aug 7 & 8) — each night features its own lineup\n\nVenue Information\n
	Madison Square Garden\, located at 4 Pennsylvania Plaza in Midtown Manhatt
	an\, is the most famous arena in the world\, hosting over 300 events per y
	ear. With a capacity of approximately 20\,000\, MSG offers world-class ame
	nities\, multiple food and beverage options\, and easy access via Penn Sta
	tion and multiple subway lines. \nTicket Information\nOfficial tickets sta
	rt at $605 and are available through Ticketmaster. Resale tickets are also
	 available through VividSeats. This is a two-night event (Aug 7 & 8) — tic
	kets are sold separately per night. Availability is limited\, so secure yo
	ur seats early. \nOfficial Tickets \nResale Tickets \nThis post contains a
	ffiliate links. We earn a commission if you purchase tickets through our l
	inks at no extra cost to you. \nAll sales are final. Show times subject to
	 change. Valid photo ID may be required for entry.\n\nhttps://comedycalend
	ar.com/event/kill-tony-live-at-madison-square-garden/\n\nFrom Comedy Calen
	dar
URL:https://comedycalendar.com/event/kill-tony-live-at-madison-square-garde
