DESCRIPTION:This post contains affiliate links. We earn a commission if you
	 purchase tickets through our links at no extra cost to you. \nOfficial Ti
	ckets (Ticketmaster) \nResale Tickets (VividSeats) \nHarland Williams LIVE
	 at Brea Improv\nCanadian comedian and actor Harland Williams brings his u
	niquely surreal and hilarious stand-up comedy to the Brea Improv for a mul
	ti-night run in August 2026. \nKnown for his roles in There’s Something Ab
	out Mary\, Half Baked\, and Dumb and Dumber\, Harland Williams is a belove
	d figure in comedy. \nEvent Details\nDate: Friday\, August 7\, 2026\nTime:
	 7:30 PM PDT (Doors open at 6:00 PM)\nVenue: Brea Improv\nAddress: 180 S B
	rea Blvd\, Brea\, CA 92821\nAge Requirement: 21+\nSeating: General Admissi
	on\, first-come first-served\nNote: Two-item minimum purchase required \nA
	bout Harland Williams\nHarland Williams is a Canadian comedian and actor k
	nown for his surreal\, absurdist humor. He has appeared in There’s Somethi
	ng About Mary\, Half Baked\, Dumb and Dumber\, and RocketMan. His stand-up
	 is known for its wild\, unpredictable energy and unique comedic perspecti
	ve. \nWhat to Expect\n\nSurreal\, absurdist stand-up from a beloved comedy
	 film veteran\nWild\, unpredictable energy and unique comedic perspective\
	nIntimate club setting at the Brea Improv\nMultiple show times available F
	riday and Saturday\n21+ show with full bar and two-item minimum\n\nVenue I
	nformation\nBrea Improv is located at 180 S Brea Blvd in Brea\, CA. Part o
	f the legendary Improv comedy club chain in Orange County\, CA. \nTicket I
	nformation\nTickets start at $25 (plus fees). \nOfficial Tickets (Ticketma
	ster) \nResale Tickets (VividSeats) \nThis post contains affiliate links. 
	We earn a commission if you purchase tickets through our links at no extra
	 cost to you. \nAll sales are final. Show times subject to change. Valid p
	hoto ID may be required for entry.\n\nhttps://comedycalendar.com/event/har
	land-williams-live-at-brea-improv/\n\nFrom Comedy Calendar
