	ckets\nResale Tickets \nJoey Diaz: 62 & Still Slinging LIVE at Ovation Hal
	l\nJoey Diaz\, one of comedy’s most beloved and brutally honest voices\, b
	rings his  tour LIVE to Ovation Hall at Ocean Casino Resort in Atlantic Ci
	ty on Friday\, August 7\, 2026. Known for his explosive storytelling and f
	earless delivery\, Joey Diaz is guaranteed to bring the house down. \nEven
	t Details\nDate: Friday\, August 7\, 2026Time: 9:00 PM ETVenue: Ovation Ha
	ll at Ocean Casino ResortAddress: 500 Boardwalk\, Atlantic City\, NJ 08401
	Doors Open: 8:00 PM \nAbout Joey Diaz\nJoey Diaz is a stand-up comedian\, 
	actor\, and podcast host best known for his long-running podcast The Churc
	h of What’s Happening Now and his frequent appearances on The Joe Rogan Ex
	perience. His debut Netflix special Trippin’ with Joey Diaz and his Billbo
	ard #1 comedy album cemented his status as one of the most authentic voice
	s in stand-up. At 62\, Joey is still going strong and funnier than ever. \
	nWhat to Expect\n\nJoey Diaz’s raw\, unfiltered stand-up comedy\nHilarious
	 personal stories from a life lived to the fullest\nExplosive delivery and
	 crowd-pleasing energy\nOne of comedy’s most beloved cult figures performi
	ng live\nAn unforgettable Friday night in Atlantic City\n\nVenue Informati
	on\nOvation Hall at Ocean Casino Resort is Atlantic City’s premier enterta
	inment venue at 500 Boardwalk\, featuring state-of-the-art sound and world
	-class dining and gaming nearby. \nTicket Information\nTickets start from 
	$50. Get your seats through official Ticketmaster or find resale tickets o
	n VividSeats! \nOfficial Tickets\nResale Tickets \nThis post contains affi
	liate links. We earn a commission if you purchase tickets through our link
	s at no extra cost to you.\nAll sales are final. Show times subject to cha
	nge. Valid photo ID may be required for entry.\n\nhttps://comedycalendar.c
	om/event/joey-diaz-live-at-ovation-hall-at-ocean-casino-resort/\n\nFrom Co
	medy Calendar
